WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:08.450
Three snapshots around Lilla Karlsö. Satellite observations sample the surrounding waters during the 2025 breeding season.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:15.170
A fixed colour scale makes the chlorophyll-a estimates comparable across these dates.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:22.490
C2RCC also estimates suspended matter and dissolved organic absorption.

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:31.290
Three dates provide snapshots. They do not measure continuous conditions or seabird food availability.
